    <div class="docs-eyebrow">ENGINE / USER INTERFACE</div>

    <h1>
        UI framework <span class="docs-accent">&amp; HUD</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="docs-lead">
        CraftyNative contains a retained-mode UI element tree and dedicated
        HUD renderers. The interface is assembled in C# rather than
        declared in XAML or HTML.
    </p>

    <h2>Retained-mode element tree</h2>

    <p>
        The UI framework has a measure, arrange, update, and draw cycle.
        <code>UIElement</code> is the base abstraction and carries layout
        and interaction state such as position, size, margin, padding,
        alignment, visibility, mouse/hover flags, parent, and Tag.
        Derived elements implement the layout and draw stages.
    </p>

    <h2>Core elements</h2>

    <div class="docs-table-wrapper">
        <table class="docs-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
