        <div>
            <strong>Not a mod-facing UI API yet</strong>

            <p>
                The UI framework is part of CraftyNative. It is not surfaced
                through the current <code>IModContext</code>. Do not imply
                that third-party mods can register HUD widgets through a
                stable public SDK API in this snapshot.
            </p>
        </div>
